 },
 {
  "marker": 18,
  "page": 22,
  "line_text": "Our estimated debt service (including principal and interest) is approximately $425 million for the remainder of 2026.",
  "document_sha256": "f369ce5f1ebeddd9a0d4ce02ce3958112267d8701d1a348dfd6dc82d2034793a"
 },
 {
  "marker": 19,
  "page": 22,
  "line_text": "We estimate our lease payments to VICI and GLPI to be approximately $687 million for the remainder of 2026.",
  "document_sha256": "f369ce5f1ebeddd9a0d4ce02ce3958112267d8701d1a348dfd6dc82d2034793a"
 },
 {
  "marker": 20,
  "page": 11,
  "line_text": "These liabilities are generally expected to be recognized as revenue within one year of being purchased, earned, or deposited and are recorded within Accrued other liabilities on the Company’s Balance Sheets.",
  "document_sha256": "f369ce5f1ebeddd9a0d4ce02ce3958112267d8701d1a348dfd6dc82d2034793a"
 },
 {
  "marker": 22,
  "page": 6,
  "line_text": "Beginning March 3, 2026, the property’s operations are reported within the Regional segment.",
  "document_sha256": "f369ce5f1ebeddd9a0d4ce02ce3958112267d8701d1a348dfd6dc82d2034793a"
 },
 {
  "marker": 23,
  "page": 18,
  "line_text": "On May 1, 2026, the Company acquired the remaining outstanding membership interest of Grand Bazaar for total consideration of approximately $66 million, inclusive of $10 million of deferred consideration.",
  "document_sha256": "f369ce5f1ebeddd9a0d4ce02ce3958112267d8701d1a348dfd6dc82d2034793a"
 },
 {
  "marker": 24,
  "page": 6,
  "line_text": "During the three and six months ended June 30, 2026, transaction costs related to the pending Merger were $10 million.",
  "document_sha256": "f369ce5f1ebeddd9a0d4ce02ce3958112267d8701d1a348dfd6dc82d2034793a"
 },
 {
  "marker": 25,
  "page": 17,
  "line_text": "Subsequent to June 30, 2026, we launched mobile sports betting and iGaming in Alberta, Canada on July 13, 2026.",
  "document_sha256": "f369ce5f1ebeddd9a0d4ce02ce3958112267d8701d1a348dfd6dc82d2034793a"
 },
 {
  "marker": 26,
